<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank buys crowns for dollars - dealers.</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank buys crowns for dollars - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, bought crowns for dollars at 7.8550 in Wednesday morning trade, several dealers confirmed.</p>
<p>&quot;The Riksbank sold dollars for crowns at 7.8550,&quot; a dealer told Reuters.</p>
<p>At 1000 GMT the crown was trading at 7.8384 against the dollar compared to 7.8270 at 0710 GMT Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
